        <div class="content-section">
            <h2 class="welcome-heading2"><b>Welcome to Mahakash Club</b> </h2>
            <p>Mahakash Club of GNIT is a space club.This club mainly focuses to foster curiosity and interest in space related fields like Astrophysics, Aerospace Engineering etc.🚀Mahakash club organises various meets and seminars to promote space awareness among Students.🌌

