        <div class="content-section" id="discoveries">
            <h2><b>Recent Space Discoveries</b></h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 30px;">Explore the latest groundbreaking findings from the cosmos that are reshaping our understanding of the universe. Hover over the cards to reveal fascinating facts!</p>
            
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="fact-card">
                    <div class="fact-card-inner">
                        <div class="fact-card-front">
                            <h4>🌌 James Webb Telescope Discovers Ancient Galaxies</h4>
                            <div class="date">December 2024</div>
                            <p>The James Webb Space Telescope has identified some of the earliest galaxies ever observed, dating back to just 300 million years after the Big Bang.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fact-card-back">
                            <p>These ancient galaxies were already incredibly massive and bright, challenging everything we thought we knew about how quickly galaxies can form!</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="fact-card">
                    <div class="fact-card-inner">
                        <div class="fact-card-front">
                            <h4><b>💧 Water Vapor Detected on Exoplanet K2-18b</b></h4>
                            <div class="date">November 2024</div>
                            <p>Scientists confirmed the presence of water vapor and potential biosignature gases in the atmosphere of exoplanet K2-18b, located 120 light-years away.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fact-card-back">
                            <p>K2-18b might have an ocean covering its entire surface under a hydrogen-rich atmosphere - imagine an alien water world!</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="fact-card">
                    <div class="fact-card-inner">
                        <div class="fact-card-front">
                            <h4>🔴<b> Mars Perseverance Finds Organic Molecules</b></h4>
                            <div class="date">October 2024</div>
                            <p>NASA's Perseverance rover discovered diverse organic compounds in Jezero Crater, providing the strongest evidence yet that Mars may have once harbored microbial life.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fact-card-back">
                            <p>These organic molecules have been preserved for over 3 billion years in Martian rocks - ancient chemical signatures of possible life!</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="fact-card">
                    <div class="fact-card-inner">
                        <div class="fact-card-front">
                            <h4>⚡ <b>Mysterious Fast Radio Bursts Traced to Magnetar</b></h4>
                            <div class="date">September 2024</div>
                            <p>Astronomers finally traced repeating fast radio bursts to a highly magnetic neutron star, solving one of astronomy's most perplexing mysteries.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fact-card-back">
                            <p>A single burst from a magnetar releases more energy in one millisecond than our Sun produces in 100 years!</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        

